    {
      "id": "repeatable-workflow-welcome",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Start here",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "width": 1160,
      "height": 370,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "style": {
        "background": "#153340",
        "color": "#e8f2ed",
        "borderColor": "#3e6970",
        "borderWidth": 1,
        "borderStyle": "solid",
        "borderRadius": 18
      },
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style=\"container-type:inline-size;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#102936,#173f4b 65%,#285662);color:#edf7f5;font-family:system-ui;padding:4cqw;border:1px solid #42636c\"><div style=\"font-size:clamp(12px,1.6cqw,22px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#8addcb\">TWILITE ZONE / WORKFLOW STARTER</div><h1 style=\"margin:2cqw 0 1cqw;font:500 clamp(32px,5.6cqw,72px)/1.03 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.04em\">Make a process<br>worth repeating.</h1><p style=\"margin:1.5cqw 0;color:#cce1dc;font-size:clamp(16px,2cqw,26px);line-height:1.35;max-width:52ch\">A reusable agent skill contract: define a Question and its answer contract, bind resources, name the tools, author the steps and gates, then run the shared preflight before asking an authorized AI to follow the process.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:1.5cqw;margin-top:2.5cqw;font-size:clamp(11px,1.25cqw,16px)\"><span style=\"padding:.7cqw 1.4cqw;background:#245463;border-radius:9px\">Editable classes</span><span style=\"padding:.7cqw 1.4cqw;background:#245463;border-radius:9px\">Meaningful connections</span><span style=\"padding:.7cqw 1.4cqw;background:#245463;border-radius:9px\">Owner-controlled writes</span></div></div>"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "repeatable-workflow-diagram",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "How to use",
      "position": {
        "x": 1210,
        "y": 0
      },
      "width": 980,
      "height": 370,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "style": {
        "background": "#153340",
        "color": "#e8f2ed",
        "borderColor": "#3e6970",
        "borderWidth": 1,
        "borderStyle": "solid",
        "borderRadius": 18
      },
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style=\"container-type:inline-size;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;border-radius:20px;background:#1a3a47;color:#edf7f5;font-family:system-ui;padding:4cqw;border:1px solid #42636c\"><div style=\"font-size:clamp(11px,1.55cqw,18px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#f2c37d\">HOW TO USE THIS TEMPLATE</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:2cqw;margin-top:3.5cqw\"><div><div style=\"font:500 clamp(30px,5cqw,52px) Georgia;color:#8addcb\">01</div><b style=\"font-size:clamp(14px,2cqw,22px)\">Define</b><p style=\"line-height:1.35;color:#d0e3dd;font-size:clamp(12px,1.45cqw,16px)\">Write the Question, answer schema, evidence and completion rule. Bind resources and tools.</p></div><div><div style=\"font:500 clamp(30px,5cqw,52px) Georgia;color:#8addcb\">02</div><b style=\"font-size:clamp(14px,2cqw,22px)\">Customize</b><p style=\"line-height:1.35;color:#d0e3dd;font-size:clamp(12px,1.45cqw,16px)\">Edit instructions, evidence and authority. The gold path defines order.</p></div><div><div style=\"font:500 clamp(30px,5cqw,52px) Georgia;color:#8addcb\">03</div><b style=\"font-size:clamp(14px,2cqw,22px)\">Rehearse</b><p style=\"line-height:1.35;color:#d0e3dd;font-size:clamp(12px,1.45cqw,16px)\">Run the imported preflight, then rehearse with an authorized agent.</p></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:2.2cqw;color:#ffe0ae;font-size:clamp(11px,1.35cqw,16px)\">This graph describes a process. It does not install a scheduler or publish anything.</div></div>"
        },
        "altText": "Seven steps: start, collect, work, verify, approve, commit, record; failed checks stop"
      }
    },
